  "A<color=#000000>l</color>l-Out Attack DMG Up": "",
  "r:\"Deal Electric damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. If the foe is not <link\\=(.+?)><u>Shocked</u></link>, there is a <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Shock</u></link> for (\\d+) turns\\. If the foe is already Shocked, increase damage by (\\d+)%\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Deal Electric damage to all foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack\\. Increase damage to the main target by (\\d+)%\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Grant Player 2 to 1 ally for (\\d+) turns, and increase {{A}}'s Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\\nFor (\\d+) turns, when an ally with Player 2 deals damage to a foe with a skill, perform a follow-up attack, dealing Electric damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack \\(max (\\d+) times\\)\\.\\nIncrease chance to activate Jolly Cooperation by (\\d+)% for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Increase Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> and follow-up damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Attack for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nActivate follow-up when allies deal damage to foes with skills for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Electric damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When an ally has Player 2, increase that ally and {{A}}'s critical rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> and Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase follow-up damage to <link\\=(.+?)><u>Shocked</u></link> foes by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "Vegetable Avatar": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Nuclear damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, gain (\\d+) <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Veggie Energy</u></link> stacks, and enter Huge Harvest state until the end of her next turn\\.\\nIf Potato Knight is present when this skill is used, automatically change to Potato Yellow at the end of the turn\\.\\nHuge Harvest: At the end of Cosmic Yui's action, activate the Resonance Harvest Havoc, dealing Nuclear damage to 1 random foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. Also, based on the current state, activate the following effects\\.\\nEggplant Purple: Gain (\\d+) Veggie Energy\\.\\nPotato Yellow: Gain Potato {{A}}, and increase All-Out Attack damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nMushroom Red: Inflict Shroom Spores on the target, and increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAsparagus Green: Restore <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> HP to the ally with the lowest remaining HP\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Veggie Knights assemble, dealing Nuclear damage to a single enemy\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase Cosmic Yui's Attack by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> and critical rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turns, and summon (\\d+) Veggie Knight according to a <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>specific order</u></link>\\.\\nAfter using this skill, other skills can be used on the same turn \\(this skill is not treated as a normal skill\\)\\.\\nPassive: At the start of Cosmic Yui's action, automatically summon (\\d+) Veggie Knight according to a specific order\\. Up to (\\d+) Eggplant Knight, Mushroom Knight, or Asparagus Knight can be summoned each\\. Up to (\\d+) Potato Knights can be summoned\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Call forth the Veggie Knights from the virtual world, increasing Cosmic Yui's Attack and critical rate\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Nuclear damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and for each Veggie Knight present, deal (\\d+) more hit of Nuclear damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. Also, if (\\d+) or more Potato Knights are present, spend all but (\\d+) Potato Knight, and for each Potato Knight spent, deal (\\d+) more hit of Nuclear damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. This skill's damage is counted as an All-Out Attack\\.\\nWhen this skill is selected and used, gain (\\d+) Veggie Energy stacks\\.\\nIf Eggplant Knight is present after activating this skill, automatically change to <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Eggplant Purple</u></link> state at the end of the turn\\.\\nPassive: At (\\d+) Veggie Energy stacks, able to spend all Veggie Energy stacks to activate damage effect of Veg-Out Attack\\. Damage is distributed equally among all foes\\. This is not treated as normal skill damage\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Yui commands her loyal Veggie Knights in a coordinated attack, dealing Nuclear damage to a single enemy\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Highlight：Deal Nuclear damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. Also, according to <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>specific rules</u></link>, activate <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Harvest Havoc</u></link> on the target\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Nuclear damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^During battle, for each <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Veggie Knight</u></link> gained, increase Cosmic Yui's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> \\(up to (\\d+) Veggie Knights\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase All-Out Attack damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\. When participating in an All-Out Attack, increase that damage more based on the total number of <link\\=\"s\\|(\\d+)\"><u>Veggie Knights</u></link> Cosmic Yui has gained\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Elec\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+foe\\\\s*\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+If\\\\s+foe\\\\s+is\\\\s+not\\\\s+Shocked,\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+chance\\\\s+to\\\\s+inflict\\\\s+Shock\\\\s*\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\nIf\\\\s+foe\\\\s+is\\\\s+Shocked,\\\\s+increase\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+(\\\\d+)%\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Elec\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+all\\\\s+foes\\\\s*\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+Increase\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+main\\\\s+target\\\\s+(\\\\d+)%\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant\\\\s+Player\\\\s+2\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+ally\\\\s+and\\\\s+increase\\\\s+([^'\\\\s]+)'s\\\\s+Atk\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s*\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\nWhen\\\\s+ally\\\\s+with\\\\s+Player\\\\s+2\\\\s+deals\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+a\\\\s+foe\\\\s+with\\\\s+skill,\\\\s+perform\\\\s+follow-up\\\\s+attack,\\\\s+dealing\\\\s+Elec\\\\s+dmg\\\\s*\\\\((\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+Atk\\\\)\\\\s+up\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+times\\\\s*\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\nIncrease\\\\s+chance\\\\s+to\\\\s+activate\\\\s+Jolly\\\\s+Cooperation\\\\s+(\\\\d+)%\\\\s*\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase\\\\s+([^\\s]+)'s\\\\s+Atk\\\\s+and\\\\s+follow-up\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\s+Also\\\\s+perform\\\\s+follow-up\\\\s+attack\\\\s+when\\\\s+allies\\\\s+deal\\\\s+skill\\\\s+dmg\\\\s+to\\\\s+foes\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.$\"": ""
}